+Mods
+====
+
+Put extra scenarios in Mods/Custom_ (or any sub folder one level deep).
+Each .sims file is listed in the Library tab; click one to load it.
+
+A .sims file is what File > Save simulation writes: a "SSS1" header, one
+"sim" line and one "body" line per body. Save a scene in the app and copy it
+here to share it.
